        <h1 style="text-align: center; color: #111; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold;">About Us</h1>
        
        <div style="margin-bottom: 40px; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;">
            <img src="/images/about-hero.png" alt="TorMart World" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
