        <div style="color: #333; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500;">
            <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">TorMart emerged from the idea, to provide a secure, fast and attractive trading-platform for our users.<br>
            When developing TorMart, we focused especially on the users security.</p>
            
            <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">TorMart uses a 2-3 Multisig escrow system. A transaction will only be enabled, if at least 2 out of 3 parties sign it. This makes an Exitscam by the vendor or TorMart practically impossible.<br>
            Unlike other markets, TorMart is not based on a credit system. This system provides significant benefits for our users.</p>
            
            <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">When a user wants to trade, he does not have to deposit funds into his account first and wait for confirmations until he can buy a product from a vendor.<br>
            This means you can purchase any product directly from a vendor of your choice and are also able to pay the order instantly.<br>
            This also helps to compensate any changes in the price of cryptocurrency..</p>
            
            <p style="margin-bottom: 40px;">In addition, TorMart is not in possession of your bitcoins - another important aspect for your security. If you have any questions or criticism, please contact our <a href="/support" style="color: #0ea5e9; text-decoration: none;">support</a>.</p>
            
